{{Infobox crops |Name = Summer Spangle |image = Summer Spangle.png |alt = summerspangle |Release = February 26, 2016 |Growth = 8 Days |Season = Summer |Seed Name = Spangle Seeds |Seed Description = Plant these in the summer. Takes 8 days to grow. |Description = Pretty flower that only grows in Summer. |Energy = No Star: +45, Silver: +63, Gold: +81 |Health = No Star: +18, Silver: +25, Gold: +32 |Crop Pierre Sell = No Star: 90g, Silver: 112g, Gold: 135g |Seed Pierre Buy = 50g }}
Summer Spangle is a flower in [[Stardew Valley]]. They can be grown during the [[Summer]] and take 8 days to grow. They sell through the shipping container for: *No Star: 90g *Silver: 112g *Gold: 135g
==Gifting== The Summer Spangle is loved by [[Caroline]] and liked by most other [[villagers]] (except by [[Clint]], [[George]] and [[Sebastian]] that hate it).
