{{Stub}}
'''Qi Fruit''' is a [[crop]] that is [[farmed]] and harvested for the [[Qi's Crop]] special order quest, started in [[Qi's Walnut Room]]. It is grown from [[Qi Bean]]s, which can only be found on [[Ginger Island]] while the quest is active. Both Qi Beans and Qi Fruit will disappear when the quest ends.
