{{tocright}}
'''Jas''' is one of the three [[villager]]s that are children, and lives with her aunt [[Marnie]] and god-father [[Shane]] at [[Marnie's Ranch]]. Marnie's Ranch is located in the northeast corner of [[Cindersap Forest]] in [[Stardew Valley (location)|Stardew Valley]].

==Daily Routine==
Jas often visits the library and studies before going out to play. If the player gifts enough amethysts she will sneak out of her house, and go behind the rocks nearby the beach. Player can reach her by walking through the hidden path.

