==Dialogue==
==='''Regular'''===

* "You smell like grass!"

*"Hi, Mr./Mrs. (Player)

*"It's fun to live on a farm."

*"1... 2... 3... 4...Oh no! I messed up again."

*"Did you know Shane's my godfather? He was a friend of my parents."

*"...they died. *sniff*"

* "Oh...Are you looking for Aunt Marnie?"

*"Miss Penny is teaching me how to write in cursive. She has such pretty handwriting."
*"...hi"
*"1...2...3...4...here comes a wave! *giggle*" (while at beach)

==='''Festivals'''===

==== Egg Festival ====

*"I hope I can find some eggs before Vincent takes them all..."

==== Luau ====

*"Vincent isn't a good dancer."

==== Dance of the Moonlight Jellies ====

* "I hope there are babies this year."

==== Festival of Ice ====

* "I wanna give him a carrot nose!"

== Friendship ==
Go to the Cindersap Forest during spring on a sunny day. Vincent will explain how to clean {{Item|Spring Onion|}}s by taking of the insects. Jas insists that the insects will not be killed after removing them from the {{Item|Spring Onion|}}s. The cutscene ends and the player learns Spring Onion Mastery, an effect that makes {{Item|Spring Onion|}}s worth 5x as much.

