== Trivia ==
*At some point in time before the events of the game take place, both of Jas' parents passed away. Being her godfather, Shane had adopted Jas, and both moved out to live with Shane's Aunt Marnie who accepts them both.
*During one of Shane's heart events, Jas seems to show genuine concern and love for Shane; when he makes a comment about killing himself, Jas begins to break out into tears.
*As there is a lack of schools near Stardew Valley, both Jas and Vincent are tutored by Penny.

