{{Starbox character |caption = "... Come back when you've got something to show me, kid." |villager = yes |location = The Mountain |address = Adventurer's Guild |friends = [[File:Marlon Icon.png|20px|link=]] [[Marlon]] }} {{tocright}} '''Gil''' is a non-marriage [[Villager]] who lives at the [[Adventurer's Guild]] in [[The Mountain]] region of [[Stardew Valley (location)|Stardew Valley]]. The player can receive rewards from him by completing various [[#Monster Eradication|eradication]] goals to slay [[Monsters]].
== Daily Routine == Gil can be visited at the Adventurer's Guild, where he sits every day in front of the fireplace. <!-- Needs info about other places he can be seen at -->
== Relationships == Gil's family is unknown. He does live with his friend [[Marlon]] but they are not related to each other.
== Monster Eradication == The player can gain rewards from Gil at the Adventurer's Guild by completing the following monster eradication goals: <!-- eradication goals need updating --> {| class="fandom-table" |+ !Monster Type !Quantity !Reward |- |[[Slimes|Slime]] |1000 |[[Slime Charmer Ring]] |- |[[Shadow Brute|Void Spirit]] |150 |[[Savage Ring]] |- |[[Bats|Bat]] |200 |Vampire Ring |- |[[Skeletons|Skeleton]] |50 |Skeleton Mask |- |Cave Insects |80 |[[Insect Head]] |- |Duggies |30 |[[Hard Hat]] |- |[[Dust sprites|Dust Sprite]] |500 |Burglars Ring |- |Rock Crab |60 |Crabshell Ring |- |Mummy |100 |Arcane Hat |- |Pepper Rex |50 |Knight's Helmet |- |[[Serpent]] |250 |Napalm Ring |- |Magma Sprite |150 |Marlon's Phone Number |}
== Dialogue == If you have not completed any of the enemy slaying quests, he will respond with "...Come back when you've got something to show me, kid" if you try and speak with him. <!-- Needs other dialogue with Gil extracted from game assets -->
